Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 18 Jul 2026 17:30:57 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13650HX (20 threads) - 15.31 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nFileDialog allows selecting folders in `FILE_MODE_OPEN_FILES` mode. However, the folder is not a file and should not be a result of FileDialog in this mode. It works as expected in `FILE_MODE_OPEN_FILE` mode. No folders can be selected there.\n\nThere are multiple editor panels which use `FILE_MODE_OPEN_FILES` (e.g. TileSetEditor, AnimationLibraryEditor, SpriteFramesEditor) which are affected by being able to select a folder in this mode.\n\nIn my opinion, there are 3 potential solutions. First, update documentation to mention that not only files, but also folders can be selected. Second, update code to prevent folders from being selected in `FILE_MODE_OPEN_FILES` mode. Third, add a new `FILE_MODE_OPEN_ANY_MULTIPLE` mode which would allow selecting files and folders.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open MRP\n2. Press \"Open\" button which will open FileDialog\n3. Select the file input text box (\"test_folder\" should have been preselected by default)\n4. Press \"Enter\"\n5. See that [\"res://test_folder\"] is passed as a result\n\nNote: Selecting multiple folders also works.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c1f3be1-c4b3-45ef-b348-36a8213e10de\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot-mvp-bug-260731-file-dialog-folders.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30581877/godot-mvp-bug-260731-file-dialog-folders.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","fo